{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE DEMO!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This only contains a small part of the content from the full release, go to the main page if you are interested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Depart:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and leave on a\u00a0Roguelike RPG expedition to the unknown, strategize your way to victory against impossible odds in turn-based combat. It's time for the tyrannical rule of the GOBLIN KING to end!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852140/extras/296b44ff8da027adc95fb97a15f0636f.avif?t=1755180151\" width=600 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEFEAT THE GOBLIN KING is a solo dev endeavour in trying to create a fast paced, challenging and engaging turn based game where you build and empower your character as you go.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852140/extras/9bb1c4e7c94e3408bb270263e8a71174.avif?t=1755180151\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852140/extras/b63cef86755601f43164aad894f19275.avif?t=1755180151\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852140/extras/a6aac40b7800787ca68d0fc246d4b2fc.avif?t=1755180151\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DEMO* with:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 characters, each with a unique moveset and stats</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 different zones with distinct visuals and challenges</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ items in the form of potions, scrolls and artifacts</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ unique enemies</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 little town to take care of</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852140/extras/48fbb70d1a1911def6447d91d83e900b.avif?t=1755180151\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852140?t=1755180151","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852140?t=1755180151","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852140/dbbaa5fcbd6ede7f35e84deb7395e60d6ba236b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755180151","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852140/dbbaa5fcbd6ede7f35e84deb7395e60d6ba236b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755180151","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE DEMO!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This only contains a small part of the content from the full release, go to the main page if you are interested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Depart:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and leave on a\u00a0Roguelike RPG expedition to the u